WEBVTT

00:00:04.101 --> 00:00:07.840
Settings → Sources: connect Garmin, Strava, Withings, intervals.icu or a calendar.

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:11.007
Garmin: sign in with your Garmin account and choose 'Connect Garmin'.

00:00:11.057 --> 00:00:14.141
'Update now' fetches the latest data right away.

00:00:14.191 --> 00:00:18.809
The mark in front of the name shows on your watch which workouts come from VibeSynergy.

00:00:18.859 --> 00:00:22.543
Or choose a mark per workout type; the defaults are filled in.

00:00:22.593 --> 00:00:29.839
Multisport gets the marks of its sports, or one mark of its own.

00:00:29.889 --> 00:00:35.105
intervals.icu gets a copy of your plan. Here you see the last copy and what was copied; your messages only list real plan changes.

00:00:35.155 --> 00:00:39.598
Older data? Import the export zip from Garmin or Strava.

00:00:39.648 --> 00:00:43.336
Sync: what VibeSynergy writes back, such as a summary in Strava.

00:00:43.386 --> 00:00:47.271
New workouts: public (published by themselves) or only me (you tick Publish yourself).

00:00:47.321 --> 00:00:54.064
Keep name, texts and gear the same: a published workout has the same name, public text and gear everywhere. Off by default.
